WEBVTT

00:08:59.847 --> 00:09:01.276
As the labor progresses,

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:05.363
those endorphins will rise
to help her with a potentially long labor.

00:09:06.299 --> 00:09:07.458
As a result,

00:09:07.482 --> 00:09:09.668
the mom is better able to cope,

00:09:09.692 --> 00:09:13.319
and she can feel more alert
and almost euphoric after the birth.

00:09:14.335 --> 00:09:16.359
Crying

00:09:16.383 --> 00:09:17.740
is just awesome.

00:09:17.764 --> 00:09:19.809
I wish there was a bigger word.

00:09:20.244 --> 00:09:24.506
Crying offers us an opportunity
for physical relief,

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:27.513
for intimacy between two individuals

00:09:27.537 --> 00:09:29.196
and ultimately,

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:32.370
it promotes physical
and mental well-being.